An assassin [[Guild|guild]] opposed to the [[Syndicate]]. Seems like it might be a [[Rogue|rogue]] only [[Faction|faction]]. Their headquarters are located in [[Arathi Highlands]], but to get there you have to come from the northeast corner of [[Hilsbrad]]. The only way found (so far) to raise reputation is to turn in [[Syndicate Emblem|Syndicate Emblems]] (usually 25 – 35). So far there is no way to get above [[Friendly]], and no [[Reward|reward]] (found) for obtaining Friendly.

